OL,4,Astrikes on Egypt-Sudan border, rights
OL,5,Agroup says
OL,6,
OL,7,FCairo has previously faced accusations
OL,8,Fof deadly strikes on gold prospectors
OL,9,Fas part of a crackdown on illicit
OL,10,Factivity along its southern border.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
